{"1571790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dust Walkers", "steam_appid": 1571790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571790/extras/0fc77a379e1dd4eda6dacd147e6d9f7b.avif?t=1771986104\" width=1374 height=616 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEPLOY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy as a DUST WALKER and protect the galaxy's most valuable resource! This top-down, action strategy game challenges you to balance constructing defenses, optimizing your build, and carefully aim your skillshots while boss after boss closes in on your mining operation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DIRECT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each run, you face a relentless assault on your operation. Deploy up to three DUST WALKERS at once, each of which can be independently controlled or grouped into a squad for ultimate firepower. Battle back the hordes, while looting and leveling each Dust Walker into unique builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571790/extras/ac1750f25cb530f200403a912efebca7.poster.avif?t=1771986104\" width=780 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571790/extras/ac1750f25cb530f200403a912efebca7.webm?t=1771986104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571790/extras/ac1750f25cb530f200403a912efebca7.mp4?t=1771986104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEVELOP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each successful operation, you return home with Dust to spend on an expansive research tree stuffed with game-breaking upgrades for your DUST WALKERS stats, weapons, classes, and rarities. DUST WALKERS that survive an expedition grow over time and can be re-deployed all the stronger, or they can be spliced for their genes and have a stat added to the next DUST WALKER that is the right fit for your squad. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEFEND</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research also includes new upgrades for your base like deployable walls, turrets, and other buildings to push back the horde and defend the Dust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571790/extras/609c051f03405f58d1efc66a48b7fb26.poster.avif?t=1771986104\" width=780 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571790/extras/609c051f03405f58d1efc66a48b7fb26.webm?t=1771986104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571790/extras/609c051f03405f58d1efc66a48b7fb26.mp4?t=1771986104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DECIMATE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each expedition fuels your growth and skill. Carve a path from weakness to game-breaking strength all on your terms, through your cunning builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you need is Dust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571790/extras/0fc77a379e1dd4eda6dacd147e6d9f7b.avif?t=1771986104\" width=1374 height=616 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEPLOY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy as a DUST WALKER and protect the galaxy's most valuable resource! This top-down, action strategy game challenges you to balance constructing defenses, optimizing your build, and carefully aim your skillshots while boss after boss closes in on your mining operation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DIRECT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each run, you face a relentless assault on your operation. Deploy up to three DUST WALKERS at once, each of which can be independently controlled or grouped into a squad for ultimate firepower. Battle back the hordes, while looting and leveling each Dust Walker into unique builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571790/extras/ac1750f25cb530f200403a912efebca7.poster.avif?t=1771986104\" width=780 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571790/extras/ac1750f25cb530f200403a912efebca7.webm?t=1771986104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571790/extras/ac1750f25cb530f200403a912efebca7.mp4?t=1771986104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEVELOP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each successful operation, you return home with Dust to spend on an expansive research tree stuffed with game-breaking upgrades for your DUST WALKERS stats, weapons, classes, and rarities. DUST WALKERS that survive an expedition grow over time and can be re-deployed all the stronger, or they can be spliced for their genes and have a stat added to the next DUST WALKER that is the right fit for your squad. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEFEND</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research also includes new upgrades for your base like deployable walls, turrets, and other buildings to push back the horde and defend the Dust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571790/extras/609c051f03405f58d1efc66a48b7fb26.poster.avif?t=1771986104\" width=780 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571790/extras/609c051f03405f58d1efc66a48b7fb26.webm?t=1771986104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571790/extras/609c051f03405f58d1efc66a48b7fb26.mp4?t=1771986104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DECIMATE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each expedition fuels your growth and skill. Carve a path from weakness to game-breaking strength all on your terms, through your cunning builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you need is Dust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Deploy as a DUST WALKER and protect the galaxy's most valuable resource! This top-down, action strategy game challenges you to balance constructing defenses, optimizing your build, and crushing your skillshots while boss after boss closes in on your mining operation.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571790/e5870104f590768030207a445e1f73025897d214/header.jpg?t=1771986104", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571790/343f6a0313a9c94682607e20a3a72759e93a41a4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771986104", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571790/343f6a0313a9c94682607e20a3a72759e93a41a4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771986104", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul clas